        "id": "a001",
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "**XL330 on the pendulum bench** of microduck_rl (100 g arm, centre of mass 96.6 mm from the axis), goal 0 -> 1 rad at 0.1 s and back at 0.9 s, kp 200, 7.4 V. Compare with the BAM identification simulator (design/xl330.py).",
